heir Apprentice. These Apprentices are the products of their training, twisted into cruel monsters of depthless evil. Although Apprentices are useful minions, a Sith Lord must always be watchful for treachery, because the need for revenge burns hot in every Sith's heart, and it is just a matter of time before an Apprentice seizes the opportunity to murder their Master and claim their mantle.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sith Apprentice Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Every Sith Apprentice secretly believes in their superiority over their Master and watches for the time to strike, to cut down the Dark Lord of the Sith and take their place. Treachery, then, is something for which a Sith Lord must be ever watchful. Thus, a Sith Lord dispatches their trained Apprentice on a variety a missions, sometimes alone, others with a squad or company of minions, and if the Apprentice dies, the Sith Lord can simply train a replacement.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sith Apprentice Statistics (CL 13)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Apprentice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Apprentice","referenceId":"reference:580167d0bdd39739"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 8; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +13; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sense Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sense_Force","referenceId":"ref